Falsifies `designware_mobile_storage::proofs::a_register_field_never_exceeds_its_width`.

The defect: the field mask is one bit too wide, so a field comes back with the bit above it set.
Every decoded capacity, manufacturer and serial inherits the stray bit.

Expected to fail: the harness's assertion that a field shorter than 32 bits is below 2^len.

diff --git a/crates/designware_mobile_storage/src/card.rs b/crates/designware_mobile_storage/src/card.rs
--- a/crates/designware_mobile_storage/src/card.rs
+++ b/crates/designware_mobile_storage/src/card.rs
@@ -89,7 +89,7 @@
     let mask = if len == 32 {
         0xffff_ffff
     } else {
-        (1u64 << len) - 1
+        (1u64 << (len + 1)) - 1
     };
     (v & mask) as u32
 }
